OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start with patchy light
OL,6,Frain or drizzle. Turning brighter by
OL,7,Flunchtime, especially in the east,
OL,8,Fwith some sunshine. Rain returning to
OL,9,Fthe far west later as winds
OL,10,Fstrengthen. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry initially this evening in
OL,14,Fthe east, but rain in the west will
OL,15,Fspread across the region. The rain
OL,16,Fheavy at times with strengthening
OL,17,Fwinds, before clearing to showers
OL,18,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
